<!DOCTYPE html><html lang="pt-BR"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>BLOCKERA HOST — Início</title><style>
:root{--bg:#050916;--panel:#0b1429;--panel2:#101d38;--line:#1d3154;--blue:#087dff;--cyan:#00d4ff;--text:#e9f2ff;--muted:#8ea6c8;--good:#19d69b}
*{box-sizing:border-box}body{margin:0;background:radial-gradient(circle at 80% 0,#0b2452 0,transparent 32%),var(--bg);color:var(--text);font-family:Inter,system-ui,Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif}
a{color:inherit;text-decoration:none}button{font:inherit;cursor:pointer}
.layout{min-height:100vh}.sidebar{position:fixed;inset:0 auto 0 0;width:250px;padding:24px 17px;background:rgba(5,10,23,.97);border-right:1px solid var(--line);display:flex;flex-direction:column;z-index:10}
.brand{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:13px;padding:8px 9px 30px}.brand-icon{width:52px;height:52px;border-radius:16px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#0bb7ff,#2346df);display:grid;place-items:center;font-weight:900;font-size:30px;box-shadow:0 0 26px #086bff55}.brand-name{font-size:18px;font-weight:900;letter-spacing:2px}.brand-name small{display:block;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:5px;margin-top:4px}
.nav{display:grid;gap:8px}.nav a{padding:14px 15px;border-radius:13px;color:#aabbd5;display:flex;gap:13px;align-items:center;transition:.2s}.nav a:hover,.nav a.active{background:linear-gradient(100deg,#123c98,#142a73);color:white;box-shadow:0 0 22px #087dff22}.nav .ico{width:23px;text-align:center;font-size:18px}
.sidebar-bottom{margin-top:auto;border-top:1px solid var(--line);padding-top:17px;color:#7287a7;font-size:12px;line-height:1.6}
.main{margin-left:250px;padding:27px clamp(18px,4vw,52px);max-width:1500px}.topbar{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:16px;margin-bottom:28px}.crumb{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)}.top-actions{display:flex;gap:10px}.btn{border:1px solid #24416b;background:#0b1730;color:#dbe9ff;padding:10px 16px;border-radius:11px}.btn.primary{background:linear-gradient(100deg,#087dff,#00b9ff);border:0;color:white;font-weight:700}.menu-toggle{display:none}
.hero{border:1px solid #1c3d70;border-radius:24px;background:linear-gradient(120deg,#0c1b39e8,#07101fe8);padding:clamp(22px,4vw,42px);position:relative;overflow:hidden}.eyebrow{color:#36cfff;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1.5px;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:800}.hero h1{font-size:clamp(30px,4.2vw,54px);line-height:1.08;margin:14px 0}.hero h1 span{color:#16a9ff}.hero p{color:#a9bddb;line-height:1.7;max-width:700px}.hero-actions{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:11px;margin-top:22px}
.cards{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));gap:15px;margin-top:22px}.card{border:1px solid var(--line);background:linear-gradient(145deg,#0b1730,#080f20);border-radius:18px;padding:20px}.card .symbol{font-size:24px;color:#16b8ff}.card h3{margin:11px 0 8px}.card p,.subtext{color:var(--muted);line-height:1.6;font-size:14px}.section-title{margin:30px 0 13px}.section-title h2{margin:0 0 5px}.section-title p{margin:0;color:var(--muted)}.statrow{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:12px;margin-top:20px}.stat{background:#0b162b;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:15px;padding:16px}.stat strong{font-size:21px;display:block;margin-bottom:5px}.stat span{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)}
input,textarea,select{width:100%;background:#071225;border:1px solid #1d3556;color:var(--text);padding:12px;border-radius:10px;margin:6px 0 12px;outline:none}textarea{min-height:120px;resize:vertical}.table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;margin-top:12px}.table th,.table td{padding:14px;text-align:left;border-bottom:1px solid #1b2c48;font-size:14px}.table th{color:#89a5c9}.pill{display:inline-block;border:1px solid #24527a;border-radius:30px;padding:4px 9px;color:#77d7ff;font-size:12px}.green{color:var(--good)}.form-card{max-width:650px}
footer{margin-top:45px;padding-top:18px;border-top:1px solid #14233c;color:#7185a5;font-size:12px}
@media(max-width:900px){.sidebar{width:240px}.main{margin-left:240px}.cards{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)}.statrow{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)}}
@media(max-width:700px){.sidebar{transform:translateX(-100%);transition:.25s;width:min(85vw,300px);box-shadow:20px 0 60px #0008}.sidebar.open{transform:translateX(0)}.main{margin-left:0;padding:17px}.menu-toggle{display:inline-flex}.topbar{margin-bottom:18px}.cards{grid-template-columns:1fr}.statrow{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}.top-actions .btn:not(.primary){display:none}.hero{padding:22px}.table-wrap{overflow:auto}}
</style></head><body><div class="layout"><aside class="sidebar" id="sidebar"><a class="brand" href="index.html"><div class="brand-icon">B</div><div class="brand-name">BLOCKERA<small>HOST</small></div></a><nav class="nav"><a class="active" href="index.html"><span class="ico">⌂</span>Início</a><a class="" href="servidores.html"><span class="ico">▤</span>Servidores</a><a class="" href="planos.html"><span class="ico">♛</span>Planos</a><a class="" href="sobre.html"><span class="ico">ⓘ</span>Sobre</a><a class="" href="suporte.html"><span class="ico">☏</span>Suporte</a><a class="" href="painel.html"><span class="ico">▦</span>Painel</a></nav><div class="sidebar-bottom">BLOCKERA HOST<br>Central de hospedagem<br>Protótipo em desenvolvimento.</div></aside><main class="main"><div class="topbar"><div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px"><button class="btn menu-toggle" onclick="toggleMenu()">☰</button><div class="crumb">BLOCKERA HOST / Início</div></div><div class="top-actions"><a class="btn" href="login.html">Entrar</a><a class="btn primary" href="cadastro.html">Cadastrar</a></div></div>
<section class="hero">
 <div class="eyebrow">◆ Plataforma de hospedagem de jogos</div>
 <h1>Seu servidor.<br><span>Seu mundo, sempre online.</span></h1>
 <p>Crie, gerencie e acompanhe seus servidores de jogos em uma central simples, moderna e preparada para crescer.</p>
 <div class="hero-actions"><a class="btn primary" href="planos.html">Explorar planos →</a><a class="btn" href="servidores.html">Ver servidores</a></div>
</section>
<div class="statrow"><div class="stat"><strong>99,9%</strong><span>Meta de disponibilidade</span></div><div class="stat"><strong>Java + Bedrock</strong><span>Minecraft em foco</span></div><div class="stat"><strong>24/7</strong><span>Central de suporte</span></div><div class="stat"><strong>🔒</strong><span>Controle da sua conta</span></div></div>
<div class="section-title"><h2>Uma central para tudo</h2><p>Comece pelo que você precisa.</p></div>
<div class="cards"><a class="card" href="servidores.html"><div class="symbol">▤</div><h3>Seus servidores</h3><p>Consulte servidores e acompanhe o status em um só lugar.</p></a><a class="card" href="planos.html"><div class="symbol">♛</div><h3>Planos</h3><p>Veja opções de recursos para sua próxima comunidade.</p></a><a class="card" href="suporte.html"><div class="symbol">◉</div><h3>Suporte</h3><p>Encontre canais de ajuda e envie uma solicitação.</p></a></div>
<footer>© 2026 BLOCKERA HOST · Protótipo em desenvolvimento</footer></main></div><script>function toggleMenu(){document.getElementById('sidebar').classList.toggle('open')}document.addEventListener('click',e=>{if(innerWidth<=700&&!e.target.closest('.sidebar')&&!e.target.closest('.menu-toggle'))document.getElementById('sidebar').classList.remove('open')})</script></body></html>
